      "cat-harness:section": "Folio visualiser — as-is intent",
      "prov:value": "**What they need to do:**\n- see which nodes (\"stickies\") the folio graph holds\n- see, for each node, what it anchors to, which theme it claims, where it was declared, and the links it carries\n- see which declared directories were scanned, and whether each one is present. A declared-but-absent directory gets a row, not silence (bean `dh4f`).\n- tell an empty folio apart from a folio that could not be loaded. The page words the two states differently.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean dh4f"
      ]
    }
  ]
